     <period-end iso-date="2027-06-15"></period-end>
     <target value="70">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">There has been no progress on the reporting obligation required to measure the achievement of the target set, as it is not yet enforceable. The reporting obligation, which applies to the Reporting Tax Years of Multinational Groups beginning on January 1, 2025, will only become enforceable up to 12 months after the end of that fiscal year. This will enable the SAR to receive Country-by-Country (CbC) information on its multinational enterprises (MNEs).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual value="0"></actual>
    </period>
